# DIRECT VERCEL PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT PROTOCOL
When completing any task or code edit, you MUST automatically build and deploy directly to Vercel production using the following steps:

1. Clean build check:
   npm run build

2. Direct Non-Interactive Vercel Production Deployment:
   npx vercel --prod --yes --token $VERCEL_TOKEN
   (OR if using linked project without token prompt):
   npx vercel --prod --yes

3. Fallback Git Backup:
   git add .
   git commit -m "feat/fix: auto-deploy update"
   git push origin main

STRICT GUARDRAIL: Never leave a task incomplete without executing the production build and deployment command. Always report the live Vercel URL upon task completion.

